messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 176827714 and 919473645? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo find the sum of 176827714 and 919473645, we can use the standard addition algorithm. We start by aligning the numbers by their place values, with the ones place aligned with the ones place, the tens place aligned with the tens place, and so on. Then, we add the digits in each column, starting from the rightmost column and moving to the left. If the sum of the digits in a column is greater than 9, we carry over the extra digit to the next column. .\n\nLet's perform the addition step by step:.\n\n```.\n  176827714.\n+ 919473645.\n-----------.\n```.\n\nStarting from the rightmost column:.\n\n1. 4 + 5 = 9, so we write down 9 and carry over 0.\n2. 7 + 6 = 13, so we write down 3 and carry over 1.\n3. 2 + 4 = 6, plus the carried over 1 makes 7, so we write down 7.\n4. 8 + 3 = 11, plus the carried over 1 makes 12, so we write down 2 and carry over 1.\n5. 6 + 7 = 13, plus the carried over 1 makes 14, so we write down 4 and carry over 1.\n6. 7 + 9 = 16, plus the carried over 1 makes 17, so we write down 7 and carry over 1.\n7. 8 + 1 = 9, plus the carried over 1 makes 10, so we write down 0 and carry over 1.\n8. 7 + 1 = 8, plus the carried over 1 makes 9, so we write down 9.\n9. 1 + 9 = 10, plus the carried over 1 makes 11, so we write down 1 and carry over 1.\n10. 7 + 1 = 8, plus the carried over 1 makes 9, so we write down 9.\n11. 6 + 1 = 7, so we write down 7.\n12. 1 + 0 = 1, so we write down 1.\n\nPutting it all together, we get:.\n\n```.\n  176827714.\n+ 919473645.\n-----------.\n1096291359.\n```.\n\nSo, the sum of 176827714 and 919473645 is 1096291359.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
