millions place):.\n\n```.\n  589473790.\n+ 219574375.\n-----------.\n15555.\n```.\n\nMoving to the next column (the hundred-millions place):.\n\n```.\n  589473790.\n+ 219574375.\n-----------.\n15555.\n```.\n\nSince 15555 is greater than 9, we carry over the extra digit (1) to the next column (the billion place):.\n\n```.\n  589473790.\n+ 219574375.\n-----------.\n15555.\n```.\n\nFinally, we add the digits in the billion place:.\n\n```.\n  589473790.\n+ 219574375.\n-----------.\n15555.\n```.\n\nSince there are no more digits to add, we can stop here. The sum of 589473790 and 219574375 is 809048165.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
