messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 654694505 and 584091166? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo find the sum of 654694505 and 584091166, we can use the standard addition algorithm. We start by aligning the numbers by their place values, with the ones place aligned with the ones place, the tens place aligned with the tens place, and so on. Then, we add the digits in each column, starting from the rightmost column (the ones place) and moving to the left. If the sum of the digits in a column is greater than 9, we carry over the extra digit to the next column. .\n\nLet's perform the addition step by step:.\n\n```.\n  654694505.\n+ 584091166.\n-----------.\n```.\n\nStarting from the rightmost column (the ones place):.\n\n```.\n  5.\n+ 6.\n---.\n  1.\n```.\n\nCarry over the 1 to the tens place.\n\n```.\n  0.\n+ 1.\n---.\n  1.\n```.\n\nCarry over the 1 to the hundreds place.\n\n```.\n  5.\n+ 1.\n---.\n  6.\n```.\n\nCarry over the 1 to the thousands place.\n\n```.\n  4.\n+ 1.\n---.\n  5.\n```.\n\nCarry over the 1 to the ten-thousands place.\n\n```.\n  9.\n+ 1.\n---.\n  0.\n```.\n\nCarry over the 1 to the hundred-thousands place.\n\n```.\n  6.\n+ 5.\n---.\n  1.\n```.\n\nCarry over the 1 to the millions place.\n\n```.\n  4.\n+ 8.\n---.\n  2.\n```.\n\nCarry over the 1 to the ten-millions place.\n\n```.\n  5.\n+ 5.\n---.\n  0.\n```.\n\nCarry over the 1 to the hundred-millions place.\n\n```.\n  6.\n+ 5.\n---.\n  1.\n```.\n\nCarry over the 1 to the billions place.\n\n```.\n  6.\n+ 5.\n---.\n  1.\n```.\n\nSo, the sum of 654694505 and 584091166 is 1338785671.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
