messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 872662112 and 913627987? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo find the sum of 872662112 and 913627987, we can use the standard addition algorithm. We start by aligning the numbers by their place values, with the ones place aligned with the ones place, the tens place aligned with the tens place, and so on. Then, we add the digits in each column, starting from the rightmost column and moving to the left. If the sum of the digits in a column is greater than 9, we carry over the extra digit to the next column. .\n\nLet's perform the addition step by step:.\n\n```.\n  872662112.\n+ 913627987.\n-----------.\n```.\n\nStarting from the rightmost column:.\n\n1. 2 + 7 = 9.\n2. 1 + 8 = 9.\n3. 1 + 9 = 10 (carry over 1).\n4. 2 + 6 + 1 (carry over) = 9.\n5. 6 + 2 = 8.\n6. 6 + 3 = 9.\n7. 2 + 1 = 3.\n8. 7 + 1 = 8.\n9. 7 + 9 = 16 (carry over 1).\n10. 6 + 1 (carry over) = 7.\n11. 2 + 9 = 11 (carry over 1).\n12. 1 + 1 (carry over) = 2.\n13. 8 + 9 = 17 (carry over 1).\n14. 1 + 1 (carry over) = 2.\n15. 8 + 9 = 17 (carry over 1).\n16. 1 + 1 (carry over) = 2.\n\nSo, the sum of 872662112 and 913627987 is 1786290100.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
