messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 823609571 and 917188030? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo find the sum of 823609571 and 917188030, we can use the standard addition algorithm. We start by aligning the numbers by their place values, with the ones place aligned with the ones place, the tens place aligned with the tens place, and so on. Then, we add the digits in each column, starting from the rightmost column (the ones place) and moving to the left. If the sum of the digits in a column is greater than 9, we carry over the extra digit to the next column. .\n\nLet's perform the addition step by step:.\n\n```.\n  823609571.\n+ 917188030.\n-----------.\n```.\n\nStarting from the rightmost column (the ones place):.\n\n1. 1 + 0 = 1.\n2. 7 + 3 = 10 (carry over 1 to the tens place).\n3. 5 + 8 = 13 (carry over 1 to the hundreds place).\n4. 9 + 8 = 17 (carry over 1 to the thousands place).\n5. 0 + 1 = 1 (carry over 1 to the ten-thousands place).\n6. 9 + 1 = 10 (carry over 1 to the hundred-thousands place).\n7. 6 + 1 = 7 (carry over 1 to the millions place).\n8. 3 + 7 = 10 (carry over 1 to the ten-millions place).\n9. 2 + 1 = 3 (carry over 1 to the hundred-millions place).\n10. 8 + 9 = 17 (carry over 1 to the billions place).\n\nNow, we add the digits in the next column (the billions place) along with the carry-over:.\n\n```.\n  823609571.\n+ 917188030.\n-----------.\n 1740797601.\n```.\n\nSo, the sum of 823609571 and 917188030 is 1740797601.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
