rite down 7.\n\n```.\n  713356439.\n+ 505012956.\n-----------.\n 72457995.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the hundred-millions place:.\n\n```.\n7 + 5 = 12.\n```.\nWe write down 2 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  713356439.\n+ 505012956.\n-----------.\n 272457995.\n```.\n\nFinally, we move to the billion place:.\n\n```.\n7 + 5 + 1 (carried over) = 13.\n```.\nWe write down 3 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  713356439.\n+ 505012956.\n-----------.\n3272457995.\n```.\n\nSo, the sum of 713356439 and 505012956 is 3272457995.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
