messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 324293279 and 667035324? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo find the sum of 324293279 and 667035324, we can use the standard addition algorithm. We start by aligning the numbers by their place values, with the ones place aligned, the tens place aligned, and so on. Then, we add the digits in each column, starting from the rightmost column (the ones place) and moving to the left. If the sum of the digits in a column is greater than 9, we carry over the extra digit to the next column. .\n\nLet's perform the addition step by step:.\n\n```.\n  324293279.\n+ 667035324.\n-----------.\n```.\n\nStarting from the rightmost column (the ones place):.\n\n```.\n  324293279.\n+ 667035324.\n-----------.\n     13.\n```.\n\nSince 9 + 4 = 13, we write down 3 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  324293279.\n+ 667035324.\n-----------.\n    13.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the tens place:.\n\n```.\n  324293279.\n+ 667035324.\n-----------.\n   133.\n```.\n\nSince 7 + 2 = 9, we write down 9 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  324293279.\n+ 667035324.\n-----------.\n  133.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the hundreds place:.\n\n```.\n  324293279.\n+ 667035324.\n-----------.\n  1333.\n```.\n\nSince 2 + 5 = 7, we write down 7 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  324293279.\n+ 667035324.\n-----------.\n  1333.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the thousands place:.\n\n```.\n  324293279.\n+ 667035324.\n-----------.\n  13333.\n```.\n\nSince 9 + 3 = 12, we write down 2 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  324293279.\n+ 667035324.\n-----------.\n  13333.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the ten-thousands place:.\n\n```.\n  324293279.\n+ 667035324.\n-----------.\n  133333.\n```.\n\nSince 3 + 0 = 3, we write down 3 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  324293279.\n+ 667035324.\n-----------.\n  133333.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the hundred-thousands place:.\n\n```.\n  324293279.\n+ 667035324.\n-----------.\n  1333333.\n```.\n\nSince 4 + 7 = 11, we write down 1 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  324293279.\n+ 667035324.\n-----------.\n  1333333.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the millions place:.\n\n```.\n  324293279.\n+ 667035324.\n-----------.\n  13333333.\n```.\n\nSince 2 + 6 = 8, we write down 8 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  324293279.\n+ 667035324.\n-----------.\n  13333333.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the ten-millions place:.\n\n```.\n  324293279.\n+ 667035324.\n-----------.\n  133333333.\n```.\n\nSince 3 + 0 = 3, we write down 3 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  324293279.\n+ 667035324.\n-----------.\n  133333333.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the hundred-millions place:.\n\n```.\n  324293279.\n+ 667035324.\n-----------.\n  1333333333.\n```.\n\nSince 2 + 6 = 8, we write down 8 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  324293279.\n+ 667035324.\n-----------.\n  1333333333.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the billion place:.\n\n```.\n  324293279.\n+ 667035324.\n-----------.\n  13333333333.\n```.\n\nSince 3 + 6 = 9, we write down 9 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  324293279.\n+ 667035324.\n-----------.\n  13333333333.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the ten-billion place:.\n\n```.\n  324293279.\n+ 667035324.\n-----------.\n  133333333333.\n```.\n\nSince 2 + 6 = 8, we write down 8 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  324293279.\n+ 667035324.\n-----------.\n  133333333333.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the hundred-billion place:.\n\n```.\n  324293279.\n+ 667035324.\n-----------.\n  1333333333333.\n```.\n\nSince 4 + 6 = 10, we write down 0 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  324293279.\n+ 667035324.\n-----------.\n  1333333333333.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the trillion place:.\n\n```.\n  324293279.\n+ 667035324.\n-----------.\n  13333333333333.\n```.\n\nSince 3 + 6 = 9, we write down 9 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  324293279.\n+ 667035324.\n-----------.\n  13333333333333