messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 650292614 and 968807354? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo find the sum of 650292614 and 968807354, we can use the standard addition algorithm. We start by aligning the numbers by their place values, with the ones place aligned, the tens place aligned, and so on. Then, we add the digits in each column, starting from the rightmost column (the ones place) and moving to the left. If the sum of the digits in a column is greater than 9, we carry over the extra digit to the next column. .\n\nLet's perform the addition step by step:.\n\n```.\n  650292614.\n+ 968807354.\n-----------.\n```.\n\nStarting from the rightmost column (the ones place):.\n\n```.\n  4.\n+ 5.\n-----.\n  9.\n```.\n\nWrite down 9 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  4.\n+ 5.\n-----.\n  9.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the tens place:.\n\n```.\n  1.\n+ 3.\n-----.\n  4.\n```.\n\nWrite down 4 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  1.\n+ 3.\n-----.\n  4.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the hundreds place:.\n\n```.\n  2.\n+ 8.\n-----.\n  0.\n```.\n\nWrite down 0 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  2.\n+ 8.\n-----.\n  0.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the thousands place:.\n\n```.\n  9.\n+ 0.\n-----.\n  9.\n```.\n\nWrite down 9 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  9.\n+ 0.\n-----.\n  9.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the ten-thousands place:.\n\n```.\n  2.\n+ 8.\n-----.\n  0.\n```.\n\nWrite down 0 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  2.\n+ 8.\n-----.\n  0.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the hundred-thousands place:.\n\n```.\n  5.\n+ 6.\n-----.\n  1.\n```.\n\nWrite down 1 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  5.\n+ 6.\n-----.\n  1.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the millions place:.\n\n```.\n  0.\n+ 6.\n-----.\n  6.\n```.\n\nWrite down 6 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  0.\n+ 6.\n-----.\n  6.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the ten-millions place:.\n\n```.\n  1.\n+ 9.\n-----.\n  0.\n```.\n\nWrite down 0 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  1.\n+ 9.\n-----.\n  0.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the hundred-millions place:.\n\n```.\n  6.\n+ 1.\n-----.\n  7.\n```.\n\nWrite down 7 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  6.\n+ 1.\n-----.\n  7.\n```.\n\nFinally, we move to the billion place:.\n\n```.\n  1.\n+ 0.\n-----.\n  1.\n```.\n\nWrite down 1.\n\n```.\n  1.\n+ 0.\n-----.\n  1.\n```.\n\nSo, the sum of 650292614 and 968807354 is 1619100008.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
