messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 688009499 and 469205927? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo find the sum of 688009499 and 469205927, we can use the standard addition algorithm. We start by aligning the numbers by their place values, with the ones place aligned, the tens place aligned, and so on. Then, we add the digits in each column, starting from the rightmost column (the ones place) and moving to the left. If the sum of the digits in a column is greater than 9, we carry over the extra digit to the next column. .\n\nLet's perform the addition step by step:.\n\n```.\n  688009499.\n+ 469205927.\n-----------.\n```.\n\nStarting from the rightmost column (the ones place):.\n\n```.\n9 + 7 = 16.\n```.\nWe write down 6 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  688009499.\n+ 469205927.\n-----------.\n     6.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the next column (the tens place):.\n\n```.\n4 + 2 + 1 (carry) = 7.\n```.\nWe write down 7.\n\n```.\n  688009499.\n+ 469205927.\n-----------.\n    76.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the next column (the hundreds place):.\n\n```.\n9 + 5 + 1 (carry) = 15.\n```.\nWe write down 5 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  688009499.\n+ 469205927.\n-----------.\n   576.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the next column (the thousands place):.\n\n```.\n0 + 0 + 1 (carry) = 1.\n```.\nWe write down 1.\n\n```.\n  688009499.\n+ 469205927.\n-----------.\n  1576.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the next column (the ten-thousands place):.\n\n```.\n0 + 2 + 1 (carry) = 3.\n```.\nWe write down 3.\n\n```.\n  688009499.\n+ 469205927.\n-----------.\n 3576.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the next column (the hundred-thousands place):.\n\n```.\n0 + 9 + 1 (carry) = 10.\n```.\nWe write down 0 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  688009499.\n+ 469205927.\n-----------.\n 03576.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the next column (the millions place):.\n\n```.\n8 + 2 + 1 (carry) = 11.\n```.\nWe write down 1 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  688009499.\n+ 469205927.\n-----------.\n 103576.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the next column (the ten-millions place):.\n\n```.\n8 + 9 + 1 (carry) = 18.\n```.\nWe write down 8 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  688009499.\n+ 469205927.\n-----------.\n 803576.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the next column (the hundred-millions place):.\n\n```.\n6 + 4 + 1 (carry) = 11.\n```.\nWe write down 1 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  688009499.\n+ 469205927.\n-----------.\n1803576.\n```.\n\nFinally, we move to the next column (the billion place):.\n\n```.\n6 + 0 + 1 (carry) = 7.\n```.\nWe write down 7.\n\n```.\n  688009499.\n+ 469205927.\n-----------.\n71803576.\n```.\n\nSo, the sum of 688009499 and 469205927 is 71803576.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
