  346536523.\n+ 782224519.\n-----------.\n  121111.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the next column (the hundred-thousands place):.\n\n```.\n  346536523.\n+ 782224519.\n-----------.\n  1211111.\n```.\n\nSince 5 + 2 + 8 = 15, we write down 5 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  346536523.\n+ 782224519.\n-----------.\n  1211111.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the next column (the million place):.\n\n```.\n  346536523.\n+ 782224519.\n-----------.\n  12111111.\n```.\n\nSince 4 + 2 + 8 = 14, we write down 4 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  346536523.\n+ 782224519.\n-----------.\n  12111111.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the next column (the ten-million place):.\n\n```.\n  346536523.\n+ 782224519.\n-----------.\n  121111111.\n```.\n\nSince 6 + 2 + 8 = 16, we write down 6 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  346536523.\n+ 782224519.\n-----------.\n  121111111.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the next column (the hundred-million place):.\n\n```.\n  346536523.\n+ 782224519.\n-----------.\n  1211111111.\n```.\n\nSince 3 + 2 + 8 = 13, we write down 3 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  346536523.\n+ 782224519.\n-----------.\n  1211111111.\n```.\n\nFinally, we move to the next column (the billion place):.\n\n```.\n  346536523.\n+ 782224519.\n-----------.\n  12111111111.\n```.\n\nSince 3 + 2 + 8 = 13, we write down 3 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n\n```.\n  346536523.\n+ 782224519.\n-----------.\n  12111111111.\n```.\n\nSince there are no more columns to add, we have reached the final sum. The sum of 346536523 and 782224519 is 12111111111.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
