messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 673732514 and 620226541? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo find the sum of 673732514 and 620226541, we can use the standard addition algorithm. We start by aligning the numbers by their place values, with the ones place aligned, the tens place aligned, and so on. Then, we add the digits in each column, starting from the rightmost column (the ones place) and moving to the left. If the sum of the digits in a column is greater than 9, we carry over the extra digit to the next column. .\n\nLet's perform the addition step by step:.\n\n```.\n  673732514.\n+ 620226541.\n-----------.\n```.\n\nStarting from the rightmost column (the ones place):.\n\n```.\n  4.\n+ 1.\n-----.\n  5.\n```.\n\nNext, we move to the next column (the tens place):.\n\n```.\n  1.\n+ 4.\n-----.\n  5.\n```.\n\nWe continue this process for each column:.\n\n```.\n  5.\n+ 4.\n-----.\n  9.\n```.\n\n```.\n  2.\n+ 2.\n-----.\n  4.\n```.\n\n```.\n  3.\n+ 0.\n-----.\n  3.\n```.\n\n```.\n  7.\n+ 2.\n-----.\n  9.\n```.\n\n```.\n  3.\n+ 2.\n-----.\n  5.\n```.\n\n```.\n  7.\n+ 6.\n-----.\n  13.\n```.\n\nSince 13 is greater than 9, we carry over the extra digit (1) to the next column (the hundreds place):.\n\n```.\n  1.\n+ 3.\n-----.\n  4.\n```.\n\n```.\n  4.\n+ 2.\n-----.\n  6.\n```.\n\n```.\n  3.\n+ 0.\n-----.\n  3.\n```.\n\n```.\n  7.\n+ 2.\n-----.\n  9.\n```.\n\n```.\n  7.\n+ 6.\n-----.\n  13.\n```.\n\nAgain, since 13 is greater than 9, we carry over the extra digit (1) to the next column (the thousands place):.\n\n```.\n  1.\n+ 3.\n-----.\n  4.\n```.\n\n```.\n  4.\n+ 2.\n-----.\n  6.\n```.\n\n```.\n  3.\n+ 0.\n-----.\n  3.\n```.\n\n```.\n  7.\n+ 2.\n-----.\n  9.\n```.\n\n```.\n  7.\n+ 6.\n-----.\n  13.\n```.\n\nWe continue this process until we reach the leftmost column:.\n\n```.\n  1.\n+ 6.\n-----.\n  7.\n```.\n\nSo, the sum of 673732514 and 620226541 is 1293959055.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
