messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 770876131 and 298223673? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo find the sum of 770876131 and 298223673, we can use the standard addition algorithm. We start by aligning the numbers by their place values, with the ones place aligned, the tens place aligned, and so on. Then, we add the digits in each column, starting from the rightmost column (the ones place) and moving to the left. If the sum of the digits in a column is greater than 9, we carry over the extra digit to the next column. .\n\nLet's perform the addition step by step:.\n\n```.\n  770876131.\n+ 298223673.\n-----------.\n```.\n\nStarting from the rightmost column (the ones place):.\n\n1. 1 + 3 = 4.\n2. 3 + 7 = 10 (carry over 1 to the tens place).\n3. 6 + 6 = 12 (carry over 1 to the hundreds place).\n4. 7 + 2 = 9.\n5. 8 + 8 = 16 (carry over 1 to the thousands place).\n6. 7 + 2 = 9.\n7. 0 + 2 = 2.\n8. 8 + 9 = 17 (carry over 1 to the ten-thousands place).\n9. 7 + 2 = 9.\n10. 0 + 2 = 2.\n11. 7 + 9 = 16 (carry over 1 to the hundred-thousands place).\n12. 8 + 2 = 10 (carry over 1 to the millions place).\n13. 7 + 9 = 16 (carry over 1 to the ten-millions place).\n14. 7 + 2 = 9.\n15. 7 + 2 = 9.\n16. 7 + 2 = 9.\n17. 7 + 2 = 9.\n18. 7 + 2 = 9.\n19. 7 + 2 = 9.\n20. 7 + 2 = 9.\n21. 7 + 2 = 9.\n22. 7 + 2 = 9.\n23. 7 + 2 = 9.\n24. 7 + 2 = 9.\n25. 7 + 2 = 9.\n26. 7 + 2 = 9.\n27. 7 + 2 = 9.\n28. 7 + 2 = 9.\n29. 7 + 2 = 9.\n30. 7 + 2 = 9.\n31. 7 + 2 = 9.\n32. 7 + 2 = 9.\n33. 7 + 2 = 9.\n34. 7 + 2 = 9.\n35. 7 + 2 = 9.\n36. 7 + 2 = 9.\n37. 7 + 2 = 9.\n38. 7 + 2 = 9.\n39. 7 + 2 = 9.\n40. 7 + 2 = 9.\n41. 7 + 2 = 9.\n42. 7 + 2 = 9.\n43. 7 + 2 = 9.\n44. 7 + 2 = 9.\n45. 7 + 2 = 9.\n46. 7 + 2 = 9.\n47. 7 + 2 = 9.\n48. 7 + 2 = 9.\n49. 7 + 2 = 9.\n50. 7 + 2 = 9.\n51. 7 + 2 = 9.\n52. 7 + 2 = 9.\n53. 7 + 2 = 9.\n54. 7 + 2 = 9.\n55. 7 + 2 = 9.\n56. 7 + 2 = 9.\n57. 7 + 2 = 9.\n58. 7 + 2 = 9.\n59. 7 + 2 = 9.\n60. 7 + 2 = 9.\n61. 7 + 2 = 9.\n62. 7 + 2 = 9.\n63