messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 252128435 and 685718605? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo find the sum of 252128435 and 685718605, we can use the standard addition algorithm. We start by aligning the numbers by their place values, with the ones place aligned, the tens place aligned, and so on. Then, we add the digits in each column, starting from the rightmost column (the ones place) and moving to the left. If the sum of the digits in a column is greater than 9, we carry over the extra digit to the next column. .\n\nLet's perform the addition step by step:.\n\n```.\n  252128435.\n+ 685718605.\n-----------.\n```.\n\nStarting from the rightmost column (the ones place):.\n\n```.\n  5.\n+ 5.\n---.\n  0.\n```.\n\nCarry over 1 to the tens place.\n\n```.\n  3.\n+ 0.\n---.\n  3.\n```.\n\nCarry over 1 to the hundreds place.\n\n```.\n  8.\n+ 6.\n---.\n  14.\n```.\n\nCarry over 1 to the thousands place.\n\n```.\n  4.\n+ 1.\n---.\n  5.\n```.\n\nCarry over 1 to the ten-thousands place.\n\n```.\n  2.\n+ 5.\n---.\n  7.\n```.\n\nCarry over 1 to the hundred-thousands place.\n\n```.\n  1.\n+ 8.\n---.\n  9.\n```.\n\nCarry over 1 to the millions place.\n\n```.\n  2.\n+ 6.\n---.\n  8.\n```.\n\nCarry over 1 to the ten-millions place.\n\n```.\n  5.\n+ 8.\n---.\n  13.\n```.\n\nCarry over 1 to the hundred-millions place.\n\n```.\n  2.\n+ 6.\n---.\n  8.\n```.\n\nCarry over 1 to the billion place.\n\n```.\n  2.\n+ 6.\n---.\n  8.\n```.\n\nSo, the sum of 252128435 and 685718605 is 937847040.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
