ater than 9, we carry over 1 to the next column and write down 2 in the hundred-millions place:.\n\n```.\n  2 + 6 + 1 = 9.\n```.\n\nSo, the sum of 681299830 and 571800877 is 1253090707.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
