messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 226798201 and 809216897? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo find the sum of 226798201 and 809216897, we can use the standard addition algorithm. We start by aligning the numbers by their place values, with the ones place aligned, the tens place aligned, and so on. Then, we add the digits in each column, starting from the rightmost column (the ones place) and moving to the left. If the sum of the digits in a column is greater than 9, we carry over the extra digit to the next column. .\n\nLet's perform the addition step by step:.\n\n```.\n  226798201.\n+ 809216897.\n-----------.\n```.\n\nStarting from the rightmost column (the ones place):.\n\n1. 1 + 7 = 8.\n2. 0 + 9 = 9.\n3. 2 + 8 = 10 (carry over 1 to the next column).\n4. 8 + 6 = 14 (carry over 1 to the next column).\n5. 9 + 1 = 10 (carry over 1 to the next column).\n6. 7 + 2 = 9.\n7. 6 + 0 = 6.\n8. 9 + 9 = 18 (carry over 1 to the next column).\n9. 7 + 0 = 7.\n10. 2 + 8 = 10 (carry over 1 to the next column).\n11. 6 + 9 = 15 (carry over 1 to the next column).\n12. 9 + 0 = 9.\n13. 2 + 8 = 10 (carry over 1 to the next column).\n14. 7 + 0 = 7.\n15. 6 + 8 = 14 (carry over 1 to the next column).\n16. 2 + 0 = 2.\n17. 1 + 8 = 9.\n18. 2 + 0 = 2.\n19. 1 + 0 = 1.\n\nNow, we add the digits in the next column (the tens place) along with the carry-over:.\n\n```.\n  226798201.\n+ 809216897.\n-----------.\n  0100000000.\n```.\n\nSince there are no more digits to add, we can stop here. The sum of 226798201 and 809216897 is 1036015100.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
