 (the billion place):.\n\n```.\n9 + 7 = 16.\n```.\n\nSince 16 is greater than 9, we carry over 1 to the next column and write down 6 in the billion place:.\n\n```.\n1.\n```.\n\nSo, the sum of 951189292 and 721703633 is:.\n\n```.\n1672892925.\n```.\n\nTherefore, the answer is 1672892925.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
