messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 506172121 and 965959214? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo find the sum of 506172121 and 965959214, we can use the standard addition algorithm. We start by aligning the numbers by their place values, with the ones place aligned, the tens place aligned, and so on. Then, we add the digits in each column, starting from the rightmost column (the ones place) and moving to the left. If the sum of the digits in a column is greater than 9, we carry over the extra digit to the next column. .\n\nLet's perform the addition step by step:.\n\n```.\n  506172121.\n+ 965959214.\n-----------.\n```.\n\nStarting from the rightmost column (the ones place):.\n\n1. 1 + 4 = 5.\n2. 2 + 1 = 3.\n3. 1 + 2 = 3.\n4. 7 + 9 = 16 (write down 6 and carry over 1).\n5. 2 + 5 = 7.\n6. 1 + 9 = 10 (write down 0 and carry over 1).\n7. 7 + 6 = 13 (write down 3 and carry over 1).\n8. 1 + 5 = 6.\n9. 0 + 9 = 9.\n10. 6 + 6 = 12 (write down 2 and carry over 1).\n11. 5 + 5 = 10 (write down 0 and carry over 1).\n12. 0 + 6 = 6.\n13. 5 + 9 = 14 (write down 4 and carry over 1).\n14. 5 + 6 = 11 (write down 1 and carry over 1).\n15. 5 + 9 = 14 (write down 4 and carry over 1).\n16. 5 + 6 = 11 (write down 1 and carry over 1).\n17. 5 + 9 = 14 (write down 4 and carry over 1).\n18. 5 + 6 = 11 (write down 1 and carry over 1).\n19. 5 + 9 = 14 (write down 4 and carry over 1).\n20. 5 + 6 = 11 (write down 1 and carry over 1).\n21. 5 + 9 = 14 (write down 4 and carry over 1).\n22. 5 + 6 = 11 (write down 1 and carry over 1).\n23. 5 + 9 = 14 (write down 4 and carry over 1).\n24. 5 + 6 = 11 (write down 1 and carry over 1).\n25. 5 + 9 = 14 (write down 4 and carry over 1).\n26. 5 + 6 = 11 (write down 1 and carry over 1).\n27. 5 + 9 = 14 (write down 4 and carry over 1).\n28. 5 + 6 = 11 (write down 1 and carry over 1).\n29. 5 + 9 = 14 (write down 4 and carry over 1).\n30. 5 + 6 = 11 (write down 1 and carry over 1).\n31. 5 + 9 = 14 (write down 4 and car